    <text key="group.doc">Available API Documentation</text>
    <text key="doc.api_text"><![CDATA[Framework API Demo demonstrates the following APIs:

1. DataProvider
   - register_plugin() / unregister_plugin()
   - get_plugin_data() / set_plugin_data() / get_all_plugin_data()
   - subscribe() / publish() / unsubscribe() (publish/subscribe)
   - save_asset() / load_asset()
   - get_active_instance()

2. BackgroundTaskManager
   - register_sync_task() (inline on caller thread) / register_async_task() (thread pool)
   - register_scheduled_task() (incl. enable/disable/unregister)
   - register_long_running_task() / stop_long_running_task(delete_from_storage=)
     / is_long_task_running()
   - cancel_task() / get_task_status()
   - get_tasks_by_plugin() / clear_completed_tasks()
   - Blocking calls (chat/embed/stream/conversation/tools/multimodal) always run
     via register_async_task()

3. ILLMService (llm_facade)
   - list_providers() / get_models() / validate_provider()
   - chat() / stream_chat() / embed()
   - Conversations: create_conversation() / send_message() / stream_send_message()
     / get_conversation() / list_conversations() / delete_conversation()
   - Tool calling: get_shared_tool_registry() (register/unregister/list_tools)
     / chat_with_tools(); entry point IPlugin.llm_tools hook
   - Multimodal: generate_image() / text_to_speech()
   - get_usage_stats()

4. PluginManager
   - get_all_plugins() / get_plugin_by_id()
   - get_all_apis() / call_plugin_method()
   - get_all_function_tools() (Function Calling)
   - get_api_description()

5. MCPManager / MCPClientManager
   - start_server() / stop_server() / is_server_running() / get_server_url()
   - service_api auto-bridged tools (sanitized {plugin_id}__{method} names)
   - connect() / disconnect() / list_connected_servers() / list_tools()

6. FontManager (font subsystem, read-only demo)
   - list_fonts() / installed_families()
   - is_available() / resolve_family() (system font fallback resolution)

7. LanguageManager / ILocalizationFacade (i18n facade, read-only demo)
   - current_language() / available_languages() / has_catalog()
   - tr() lookup (all plugin texts are resolved via the facade)

8. LoggerManager
   - debug() / info() / warning() / error() / critical()

9. utils &amp; theme
   - is_ui_thread() / run_in_ui_thread() / run_in_ui_thread_sync()
   - load_image_as_base64()
   - ThemeManager.theme_changed theme following]]></text>
